            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A mobile terminal according to an embodiment of the present disclosure can receive an automatic registration request for automatic registration of one of one or more home appliances displayed on an automatic registration guide screen, and display an automatic registration process screen indicating that automatic registration of the corresponding home appliance is in progress in response to the received automatic registration request.</p>
